# Store all text as LF in the repository, regardless of contributor platform.
# Git already does this here via core.autocrlf on Windows checkouts; this makes
# it explicit so a contributor with different local settings cannot commit CRLF.
* text=auto

# Skills are copied verbatim onto Linux and macOS by the installers, so the
# files that ship must check out as LF everywhere.
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never filtered, never diffed as text.
*.jpg -text
*.png -text
